her mask and hood in C2","fontFamily":"Signika","fontSize":48,"textColor":"#FFFFFF","textAlpha":1,"hidden":false,"locked":false,"flags":{"tagger":{},"perfect-vision":{"enabled":false,"fit":false,"prototype":null}}},{"author":"ZWZhNTMzZTE2NzI3","shape":{"type":"r","width":1275,"height":263,"radius":null,"points":[]},"x":233.59489046638555,"y":525.4670907714863,"z":0,"rotation":0,"bezierFactor":0,"fillType":0,"fillColor":"#FFFFFF","fillAlpha":0.1,"strokeWidth":8,"strokeColor":"#FFFFFF","strokeAlpha":1,"texture":null,"text":"Lady Ammalia Cassalanter: Roll 1d100. 01-70, She's tending her butterfly garden in C25. 71-90, she's smoking on the balcony in C25a. 91-100 She's weeping before Osvaldo in the attic in area C24.","fontFamily":"Signika","fontSize":48,"textColor":"#FFFFFF","textAlpha":1,"hidden":false,"locked":false,"flags":{"tagger":{},"perfect-vision":{"enabled":false,"fit":false,"prototype":null}},"_id":"wwzu47UbzjWgZCNy"},{"author":"ZWZhNTMzZTE2NzI3","shape":{"type":"r","width":1275,"height":263,"radius":null,"points":[]},"x":246.09489046638555,"y":950.4670907714863,"z":0,"rotation":0,"bezierFactor":0,"fillType":0,"fillColor":"#FFFFFF","fillAlpha":0.1,"strokeWidth":8,"strokeColor":"#FFFFFF","strokeAlpha":1,"texture":null,"text":"Lord Victoro Cassalanter: Roll 1d100. 01-70 He's in his office (area C6). 71-90 He's in the reading room (area C4). 91-100 he's with Ammalia at one of her three locations.","fontFamily":"Signika","fontSize":48,"textColor":"#FFFFFF","textAlpha":1,"hidden":false,"locked":false,"flags":{"tagger":{},"perfect-vision":{"enabled":false,"fit":false,"prototype":null}},"_id":"PTvbvlQI4ZcP4a5F"},{"author":"ZWZhNTMzZTE2NzI3","shape":{"type":"r","width":1275,"height":263,"radius":null,"points":[]},"x":246.09489046638555,"y":1350.4670907714863,"z":0,"rotation":0,"bezierFactor":0,"fillType":0,"fillColor":"#FFFFFF","fillAlpha":0.1,"strokeWidth":8,"strokeColor":"#FFFFFF","strokeAlpha":1,"texture":null,"text":"Terenzio and Elzerina Cassalanter: Roll 1d100. 01-50, they're playing in their room (area C18). 51-75 They're in the library (C3). 76-100 They're chasing butterflies in the garden (area C25).","fontFamily":"Signika","fontSize":48,"textColor":"#FFFFFF","textAlpha":1,"hidden":false,"locked":false,"flags":{"tagger":{},"perfect-vision":{"enabled":false,"fit":false,"prototype":null}},"_id":"Fy5XVmkdeBUhjIk4"},{"author":"ZWZhNTMzZTE2NzI3","shape":{"type":"r","width":1275,"height":225,"radius":null,"points":[]},"x":233.59489046638555,"y":2325.4670907714863,"z":0,"rotation":0,"bezierFactor":0,"fillType":0,"fillColor":"#FFFFFF","fillAlpha":0.1,"strokeWidth":8,"strokeColor":"#FFFFFF","strokeAlpha":1,"texture":null,"text":"The below three head servants are noted as cult fanatics but are in disguise as tiefling servants. Replace their tokens with the image of a tiefling.","fontFamily":"Signika","fontSize":48,"textColor":"#FFFFFF","textAlpha":1,"hidden":false,"locked":false,"flags":{"tagger":{},"perfect-vision":{"enabled":false,"fit":false,"prototype":null}},"_id":"EL7rRydtgTj5cANr"},{"author":"ZWZhNTMzZTE2NzI3","shape":{"type":"r","width":1287,"height":175,"radius":null,"points":[]},"x":208.59489046638555,"y":6600.467090771486,"z":0,"rotation":0,"bezierFactor":0,"fillType":0,"fillColor":"#FFFFFF","fillAlpha":0.1,"strokeWidth":8,"strokeColor":"#FFFFFF","strokeAlpha":1,"texture":null,"text":"On founders day several nobles and 100 of Waterdeep's poorest comoners gather on the lawn, ballroom, the entry, dining room and foyer","fontFamily":"Signika","fontSize":48,"textColor":"#FFFFFF","textAlpha":1,"hidden":false,"locked":false,"flags":{"tagger":{},"perfect-vision":{"enabled":false,"fit":false,"prototype":null}},"_id":"2IWL3CPTeEXQKup5"},{"author":"ZWZhNTMzZTE2NzI3","shape":{"type":"r","width":1302,"height":413,"radius":null,"points":[]},"x":208.59489046638555,"y":6912.967090771486,"z":0,"rotation":0,"bezierFactor":0,"fillType":0,"fillColor":"#FFFFFF","fillAlpha":0.1,"strokeWidth":8,"strokeColor":"#FFFFFF","strokeAlpha":1,"texture":null,"text":"Four doppelgangers from the Yawning Portal have slipped into the party disguised as nobles. Their leader, Bonnie (see “Familiar Faces” journal entry), poses as a minor noblewoman going by the name Lymeria Lhaurilstar; she was hoping to have a fun night at the party, but she’s willing to help the characters if they need aid.  NOTE: REMEMBER TO CHANGE THE TOKEN PICTURE TO A NOBLE.","fontFamily":"Signika","fontSize":48,"textColor":"#FFFFFF","textAlpha":1,"hidden":false,"locked":false,"flags":{"tagger":{},"perfect-vision":{"enabled":false,"fit":false,"prototype":null}},"_id":"ZMzKAskYyuvVzCIw"}],"flags":{"ddb":{"bookCode":"wdh","ddbId":103093,"cobaltId":null,"parentId":561,"contentChunkId":"ddb-missing-wdh-103093","foundryVersion":"10.291","versions":{"ddbMetaData":{"name":"Cassalanter Villa (Villa Cellar)","bookCode":"wdh","contentChunkId":"ddb-missing-wdh-103093","lastUpdate":"0.3.28","notes":"0.3.28","tokens":"0.3.28","walls":"0.3.28","lights":"0.3.28","drawings":"0.3.28","foundry":"10.291"}},"noteInfos":[{"ddbId":62,"cobaltId":null,"parentId":561,"splitTag":"h4","slug":"hell-of-a-summer#CassalanterVilla","tagIdFirst":"C1EntranceHall","contentChunkIdStart":"003b7f15-fc01-42cc-a344-0c9a0b370e40","tagIdLast":"","contentChunkIdStop":"EOF","sceneName":"Cassalanter Villa"}]},"stairways":[{"_id":"JDTOtpFfvWjel0VC","scene":"KcTIXmZEGHT0iFic","name":"sw-Z1eTvDvb","x":5350,"y":8350,"label":"","fontFamily":"","fontSize":null,"textColor":null,"icon":null,"width":null,"height":null,"disabled":false,"hidden":false,"animate":false,"partnerSceneLabel":false},{"_id":"xj6mJUIcPj9wBgcx","scene":"uvDSpsgyc3bK41wr","name":"sw-E72RqPqm","x":5950,"y":9050,"label":"Stairway farther down","fontFamily":"Arial","fontSize":null,"textColor":null,"icon":null,"width":null,"height":null,"disabled":false,"hidden":false,"animate":false,"partnerSceneLabel":false}],"perfect-vision":{"fogRevealed":false,"daylightColor":"","darknessColor":""},"dynamic-illumination":{},"ddbimporter":{"v